L1: Impact of exercise training and supplemental oxygen on submaximal exercise performance in patients with COPD
L2: Scandinavian Journal of Medicine & Science in Sports (2020)
L3: Daniel Neunhäuserer, Bernhard Reich, Barbara Mayr, Bernhard Kaiser, Bernd Lamprecht, David Niederseer, Andrea Ermolao, Michael Studnicka, Josef Niebauer
